            "value" : "Adding the code to your header allows the <a> element to remain invisible. The rel=\\\"me\\\" attribute prevents impersonation on websites with user-generated content – so it’s important to keep it."
          }
        },
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Når du tilføjer koden til din header, forbliver <a>-elementet usynligt. Attributten rel=\\\"me\\\" forhindrer identitetstyveri på websteder med brugergenereret indhold – derfor er det vigtigt at beholde den."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Durch das Hinzufügen des Codes in den Header kann das <a> -Element unsichtbar bleiben. Der wichtige Teil ist rel=\\\"me\\\", um Nachahmungen zu unterbinden – daher sollte das Attribut nicht entfernt werden."
          }
        },
        "el" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Adding the code to your header allows the <a> element to remain invisible. The rel=\\\"me\\\" attribute prevents impersonation on websites with user-generated content – so it’s important to keep it."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
